    "question": "You said you want to work at our firm to gain exposure to bigger, more complex deals. But what if an even bigger bank comes calling next year – would you move again?",
    "sampleAnswer": "This one will come up if you’re working at a regional boutique and you’re interviewing with a\nmiddle-market bank, elite boutique, or a slightly larger bank.\nTo answer this, you should say that this bank offers the ideal mix of deal size/complexity and\nclient interaction. Yes, a larger bank would offer bigger and more complex deals, but you also\nvalue the team size and client interactions, and you prefer this firm because of the balance it\noffers."
